WP04 contract proof

Added:
- App/game identity primitive refs for package, bundle, AppUserModelId, desktop
  entry, token, executable path ref, publisher/signature, file hash, launcher
  app id, launcher manifest id, store id, parent label, and display label.
- Identity primitive refs live in
  packages/activity-domain/src/app-game-identity-primitives.ts and are
  re-exported through packages/activity-domain/src/app-game.ts.
- AppGameIdentitySchema for weak, candidate, deterministic, parent-labeled, and
  AI-assisted identity confidence.
- AppGameIdentityMergeProofSchema for deterministic merge proof across multiple
  source identities.
- Focused tests in packages/activity-domain/tests/app-game-identity.test.ts.

Proof cases:
- Deterministic game identity with child-game proof parses.
- Display-label-only identity remains weak and unknown.
- Launcher identity cannot become native game identity without child-game proof.
- Display-label-only merge is rejected.
- Store-package and process merge requires deterministic refs.
- Parent label changes display only and does not create raw identity.
